<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian Breweries Q3 profit improves.</title>
<headline>Nigerian Breweries Q3 profit improves.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third quarter result for Nigerian Breweires to end-September 1996.</p>
<p>			 (In million naira)</p>
<p>				 1996	 1995</p>
<p>Turnover		     7,595  vs  6,769</p>
<p>Profit before taxation   1,542  vs  1,532</p>
<p>Taxation			 617  vs    689</p>
<p>Profit after taxation	925  vs    843</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
